  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tall Tall Grass**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Believe**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2019-08-17.Aud.Matrix.Flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 17 songs; 92 min [1]\n- **BillyStrings2019-08-17.SPC4.Flac24**: source not stated; 17 songs; 92 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Billy [1]\n- Set ran 3:00 to 4:30 PM; Billy walked to the front of the audience to take song requests; Jarrod teased Old Grimes [1]\n- Set ran 3:00 to 4:30 PM; Billy went to the front of the audience for song requests; Jarrod teased Old Grimes [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2019-08-17.Aud.Matrix.Flac16**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: SP C4 Hyper Cards + Church Audio CA-11 Omnis > CA 9200 PreAmp (+30 Gain) > TASCAM DR-70D (24Bit/44.1) [1]. Also: Two sources combined: Church Audio CA-11 omnis via CA 9200 preamp, plus Studio Project C4 mics, both recorded on TASCAM DR-70D at 24-bit/44.1; Lineage runs SD card to Audacity (combined, amplified, dithered to 16 bit), then CDWAV tracking, FLAC, tagged in Foobar2000 1.4.2 [1]\n- **BillyStrings2019-08-17.SPC4.Flac24**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Studio Project C4 Hyper Card Mics > Beyerdynamic PowerAmp > TASCAM DR-70D (24Bit/44.1) [2]. Also: Mics were beside the soundboard in the tapers section, 12 feet up; SD card to CD Wave to FLAC, tagged in Foobar2000 [2]",
